---
// Section 01 — Hero
---

<section id="top" class="relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 pt-20 sm:pt-28 pb-24 sm:pb-32">
    <!-- 状态标签 -->
    <div class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-line rounded-full px-4 py-2 mb-10 bg-card/60">
      <span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-dim"
        >PROJECT STATUS: <span class="text-accent">JUST STARTED</span></span
      >
    </div>

    <!-- 主标题 -->
    <h1
      class="reveal reveal-d1 font-black leading-[1.06] tracking-tight text-[clamp(2.6rem,8vw,6.5rem)] headband"
    >
      <span class="glitch" data-text="孙哥，播客听完了。">孙哥，播客听完了。</span><br />
      <span class="text-gradient fire">网站已经上线了。</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- 副标题 -->
    <p class="reveal reveal-d2 mt-8 max-w-2xl text-dim text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed">
      一个年轻人听完四小时播客后，决定不再只做笔记，而是打开
      AI，亲手搭建一个网站。没有人脉、没有资源，那就先动手。
    </p>

    <!-- 英文强调语 -->
    <p class="reveal reveal-d2 mt-6 font-mono text-sm sm:text-base tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/90">
      <span class="monkey-decor">🐒</span>
      I LISTENED. <span class="text-faint">/</span> I LEARNED. <span class="text-faint">/</span>
      <span class="text-accent">I SHIPPED.</span>
      <span class="monkey-decor">🐒</span>
    </p>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="reveal reveal-d3 mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="#timeline" class="btn btn-primary">探索项目 ↓</a>
      <a href="#health" class="btn">大健康实验室</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn">联系与合作</a>
    </div>

    <!-- 品牌条：随域名切换 -->
    <div
      class="reveal reveal-d4 mt-20 pt-8 border-t border-line flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-faint tracking-[0.15em]"
    >
      <span class="text-dim" data-brand="name">SUN STUDIES</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span data-brand="subtitle">孙学实践基地</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span data-brand="tagline">AI × Health × Learning × Action</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
